      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope akuŵeceta kuti, “Pitijiciyika ndaŵi jelejo jwalakwejo tacililinganyicisya liŵasa lya Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nduluko ja mesi, kuti jemanjajo pamo ni ŵandu ŵa ku Yelusalemu ŵatyocesye ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni yakusakala yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pandaŵi jelejo tinjityosya mena ga milungu jakupanganya mcilambomo, pangali soni jutacijikumbucila soni. Tinjimtyosya jwalijose jwakulikolanga kuti ali jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pamo ni msimu wakunyalaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga jwine jwalijose akwendelecela kulocesya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " babagwe ni mamagwe tacimsalila jwalakwejo kuti akwenela kuwulajidwa, pa ligongo lyakuti m'malo mwakuti aŵecete maloŵe ga AMBUJE akuŵeceta ya unami. Jwalakwejo pitacilocesyaga babagwe ni mamagwe tacimcopa mpaka kuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jelejo pitijicikwana, jwakulocesya julijose tacitenda soni pa yindu yele akuti yiŵayiweni kupitila m'mesomkulola pa ndaŵi jiŵalocesyaga kupitila mesomkulola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'malo mwakwe, tacijila kuti, ‘Une nganimba jwakulocesya. Une ndili jwakulima — mbele ndili mkulima pa umi wangu wosope.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwine naga akuwusya kuti, ‘Nambi maŵanga gali ku mgongo kwenugo mwatesile cici?’ Jwalakwejo tacijila kuti, ‘Liŵangali nalipatile ku nyumba ja ajangu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lilamusi lyakuti awulaje jwakucinga jwa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE Ŵamaciligosope akuti, “Mjimuce, m'mwe upanga, ni mlimbane ni jwakucinga jwakungamulila une masengo! Mumwulaje, nipo ngondolo tisipwilingane. Pelepo tinjimenyana nawo ŵandu ŵangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo mwa mbali sitatu sya ŵandu mcilambo mosopemo, siŵili tisiciwulajidwa, nipo mbali jimo ni jitijicisigala ja umi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa mbali jatatuji tinjaŵika pa moto, tinjaswejesya mpela mwele mwakusaswejesela golidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Kaneko tacipopela kwa Une, nipo Une tinjajanga kuŵenda kwawo. Tinjasalila kuti jemanjajo ali ŵandu ŵangu, nipo tacijiticisya kuti Une ndili Mlungu jwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
